      "created_at": "2016-02-27T16:38:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"much0gust0\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n much0gust0:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>That's reasonable. But with all of the color shades of a Sentinels card, that would take quite some time. I'm not opposed to it…but I was seeing if the community already had a cool idea out there without me having to do all of it =P</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Open in Photoshop or Gimp or similar program, select by colour (black), invert selection, delete. That should remove everything that isn't black.</p>",
