      "raw": "<p>Howzzat?</p><p>How I did it:</p><ol><li>Opened pic in Photoshop</li><li>Image -&gt; Adjustments -&gt; Levels</li><li>Dragged the triangle on the right side of the graph all the way to the left, which removed nearly all the color (only his blue eyes and yellow on the costume were left)</li><li>Used the Magic Wand to remove those last bits of color</li></ol><p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://greaterthangames.com/system/files/forum/attachments/Setback%20-%20bw_0.jpg\" /></p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
