      "created_at": "2016-02-27T17:26:01.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I can't give it up. &nbsp;You can get most of the way there in Photoshop by just applying the Photocopy filter (Filter -&gt; Sketch -&gt; Photocopy) then messing with the Levels a little to darken the black outlines. &nbsp;The image is messier than I'd prefer, but Fixer is a messy guy.</p><p><span alt=\"\" class=\"broken-image\" title=\"This image is broken\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-unlink svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#unlink\"></use></svg></span></p>",
